# Business behavior (quick SSOT)

Full detail: [`prd/behavior/cross-cutting.md`](prd/behavior/cross-cutting.md).

## Locale

- SSOT: Settings SQLite `locale` (ru|en), not OS alone
- Manual change updates locale only; OS change on AppState active overwrites when system locale code changed
- Non-ru system → en; remount navigators with `key={locale}`

## Default download quality

- Default `720`; options best|1080|720|480|360
- Pre-selects download sheets via `pickPreferredQuality`; per-download override allowed
- Does **not** force online WebView quality

## Downloads

- Process death: in-flight → `failed` + interrupted; user must Retry
- Movie retry wipes partial dir (CDN URLs expire)
- Movie jobs serialized; YouTube not on that chain
- Prefer WebView media fetch for CDN 403 avoidance

## Watch progress

- Resumable if position ≥ 30s and not completed
- Completed at ≥90% or (duration ≥ 15min and remaining &lt; 120s) → delete row
- Sanitize suspicious short WebView durations before upsert

## Orientation

- Unlocked app-wide; reflow via breakpoints — no lock/unlock API
